WEBVTT

00:15:57.415 --> 00:16:01.276
Jautājiet mani, ko es nedarīju.”

00:16:01.276 --> 00:16:06.533
Es viņai neaplauzu spārnus, tas arī viss.

00:16:06.533 --> 00:16:09.415
Liels paldies.

00:16:09.415 --> 00:16:14.911
(Aplausi)

00:16:14.911 --> 00:16:18.911
Paldies. Liels paldies. Paldies. (Aplausi)